<title>USA: Magal Security files for share offer.</title>
<headline>Magal Security files for share offer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Magal Security Systems, Ltd said on Friday that it filed a registration statement with the U.S. Securites and Exchange Commission for a two million share public offering.</p>
<p>The deal would be underwritten by Josephthal, Lyon &amp; Ross Inc, the company said.</p>
<p>Magal develops, manufactures and markets complex computerized systems, including automatic explosive device detection systems, perimeter security and motion detection systems.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
